        "abstract": "People use more and more electronic devices at home, in their car or in the office and with the proliferation of smart connected devices. The Internet of things (IoT) is a vision of interconnected everyday objects and self-configuration wireless networks of sensors. In this paper, we describe a new concept of the social IoT as a pervasive interaction paradigm for the information sharing in the Web of devices. And we propose the architecture of the system for information sharing in the environment of IoT.",
